.TH AECAL 1 "2026-03-09"
.
.SH NAME
aecal \- innovative console calendar
.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBaecal\fI [option] <arg>\fP
.fi
.
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR aecal
Innovative console \fIcalendar\fP based on cal.c from bsd 4.2. 
The configuration is performed by modifying the \fBconfig.h\fP file.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -y, y, year
will display the entire current year
.B NOTE:
aecal can receive the month and year as arguments, see \fBEXAMPLES\fB
.TP
.B -e, e, easter \fI<arg>\fP
display the date of Easter
.TP
.B -h, h, help
display the help menu
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP 
.B aecal
will display the current month of the year
.TP
.B aecal 1023
will display the entire year 1023
.TP
.B aecal 1023 4
will display the entire 4th month of 1023
